SUMMARY:AsiaTown Passport
DESCRIPTION:Explore Cleveland's AsiaTown while supporting local businesses 
 through the AsiaTown Taste   Care Passport Challenge! Pick up a passport at 
 participating locations\, including the ArtBox\, and collect stamps as you 
 visit neighborhood businesses. Participants who collect six stamps and 
 submit their passport online will be entered for a chance to win exciting 
 prizes\, including tickets to Cleveland sports games\, local experiences\, 
 and more. Discover new favorites while helping strengthen and celebrate the 
 AsiaTown community.
LOCATION:ArtBoxEvent\, Offsite
ORGANIZER;CN="Tai-Renee King":MAILTO:tai-renee.king@cpl.org
CATEGORIES:School of Arts & Culture
UID:LibCal-8758-17093140
URL:https://cpl.libcal.com/event/17093140
END:VEVENT
