SUMMARY:FamilySpace
DESCRIPTION:Who?\n\n\n	Families with children from birth to 5 
 years\n	old\n\n\nWhat?\n\n\n	A fun playdate with other caregivers 
 and\n	children from your community\n	A fun\, safe place for caregivers to 
 foster\n	early literacy skills\n\n\nWhy?\n\n\n	We have a great selection of 
 activities\, toys and\n	games that promote kindergarten readiness\n	We have 
 a dedicated staff that can connect you\n	with community resources that meet 
 your needs\n
LOCATION:Carnegie West - Children's Room - FamilySpace\, Carnegie West
ORGANIZER;CN="Keely Schulz":MAILTO:keely.schulz@cpl.org
CATEGORIES:School of Family & Education
UID:LibCal-8758-15470723
URL:https://cpl.libcal.com/event/15470723
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260806T140000Z
DTEND:20260806T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260806T000000Z
SUMMARY:Career Services
DESCRIPTION:Looking to enter or re-enter the workforce? Meet one-on-one 
 with career development specialists as they guide you through the 
 vocational and career exploration process\, gain skills and training\, and 
 receive job coaching including resume help and interview prep. Staff can 
 also provide assistance navigating social and other services and referrals 
 to community-based programs.\n\nThis programming is made possible through a 
 partnership with Goodwill Industries of Greater Cleveland.
LOCATION:Glenville - Meeting Place C (St Clair Conference Room)\, Glenville
ORGANIZER;CN="Emily Szymanski":MAILTO:emily.szymanski@cpl.org
CATEGORIES:School of Health & Wellbeing
UID:LibCal-8758-15512282
URL:https://cpl.libcal.com/event/15512282
END:VEVENT
