SUMMARY:0 to 3 Read to Me
DESCRIPTION:\n\nBuilding your child’s brain is as simple as reading\, 
 singing\, playing\, and talking! Join us as we read engaging books and sing 
 lively songs with plenty of time for playing and talking! For children ages 
 0 to 3 (36 months) and a caring adult. Siblings welcome.\n\nQuestions? Call 
 216-623-7114 or email education.programs@cpl.org\n\nTo browse a complete 
 listing of upcoming 0 to 3: Read to Me programs\, visit cpl.org/0-to-3\n
LOCATION:Woodland - Children's Space\, Woodland
ORGANIZER;CN="Leslie Barrett":MAILTO:leslie.barrett@cpl.org
CATEGORIES:School of Literature
