BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260806T150000Z
DTEND:20260806T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260806T000000Z
SUMMARY:Aspire: Free GED Prep\, Tutoring\, Adult Literacy\, and Basic Skills Classes
DESCRIPTION:This series of free Aspire adult education classes is presented 
 by the Neighborhood Centers Association. NSA provides free education and 
 tutoring for adults (and teens ages 16 and up). These classes are for 
 beginning readers\, those seeking a GED or HiSET\, or high school grads who 
 need to improve skills for college\, employment\, or career 
 advancement.\n\n\nRegistration is required. Register here or call 
 216-727-3825.  For more information\, visit https://www.gcnca.org/aspire/.
LOCATION:Woodland - Community Space\, Woodland
ORGANIZER;CN="Sherri Jones":MAILTO:sherri.jones@cpl.org
CATEGORIES:School of Social Services
UID:LibCal-8758-16416730
URL:https://cpl.libcal.com/event/16416730
END:VEVENT
